     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I was trying to create mapreduce program based on selecting variables from a dataset. The following program worked perfectly.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;AMC&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;AMC&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;AMC&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Buick&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Buick&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>MPG</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">22</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">17</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">22</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>WEIGHT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2930</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3350</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2640</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3250</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4080</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>PRICE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">