v</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 keyval</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v$Model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">v$PRICE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               reduce</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 keyval</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">k</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                 <br>               </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br><br><br>out1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">from</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">View</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">out1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>But when I was running the following code, I&#39;m not getting any output from the map task. So even though the code is not throwing any error, I&#39;m not getting output. I&#39;ll be grateful if somebody can tell me where I&#39;m making the mistake.</div></